                "description": "The Application ID.\n\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "The returned values will be the \"base\" values for the Application. The overridden value for the Environment can be retrieved via the `/orgs/{orgId}/apps/{appId}/envs/{envId}/values` endpoint."
        },
